  Running non-stop turn
  Choose how this message should join the active non-stop session.

› 1. Steer now (default)     Submit this message as an immediate steer against
                             the active turn.
  2. After next normal stop  Wait for the next point where Codex would
                             normally stop.
  3. Timed release…          Hold the message and inject it after a wall-clock
                             delay.

  Esc restores the submitted draft to the composer.
  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
